:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Riceball Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Sumo Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased for 150 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Singapore (Empire of Cats)|Singapore]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] greatly increases his movement speed and gains [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable in Ehime in Chapter 2 and costs 10000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked from beating Singapore in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 75 Cat Food.

